+
+The practice set is rebuilt from the question writer onward under version 1.1, in the new study folder `CASALESCENCE_NOETICS_v0_1__PLAN_v1_1`. The eligibility files (`optionb/elig/`) and the role notes (`optionb/notes_role/`) are made again in this folder by the unchanged tools `tools/ob_eligibility.py` and `tools/ob_role_notes.py` from the same sealed sources and the same seeds; their bytes are expected to equal the v1.0 files except the `made_by` time. Version 1.1 starts from 8 practice settings. The reserve rule of section 12.1 runs again under the version 1.1 brief; a reserve setting moves to practice only when that rule moves it. A reserve setting that does not move stays in the final set. The operator has read the version 1.0 practice questions and keys of all four reserve settings in the diagnosis of section 28.1; those questions were written by the blind writer, are never reused, and the final questions are written by a new blind pass of the same writer, so no person who saw them writes or edits any question or key. The version 1.0 practice files stay sealed in `CASALESCENCE_NOETICS_v0_1` and are not copied here. The v1.0 seal chain in `CASALESCENCE_NOETICS_v0_1/optionb/SEAL_OPTIONB.jsonl` stays as evidence and is never edited. Every v1.1 file change is recorded in `PLAN_V1_1_CHANGES.json` with its old and new sha256, and the unified diffs are in `PLAN_V1_1_DIFFS/`.
