+### 28.6 Review before anything runs
+
+A separate reviewer sub-agent reads the whole v1.1 package (the plan diff, the constants diff, the formats diff, the tool diffs) before anything runs. Its record is `PLAN_V1_1_REVIEW.json`, beside this plan. A BLOCKER or MAJOR holds the run. The custody rules of section 10 hold: the writer still sees only the brief and the fenced passages; the solvers still see only passage, question and options; no person edits a question or a key; the operator runs programs.
